  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **I'm Still Here /** (1 review): Followed by a Last Train to Clarksville quote [3]\n- **Meet Me at the Creek** (1 review): Contains a Cosmic Highway tease and a Lion King tease [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Poor Ellen Smith**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Hold That Woodpile Down**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Gotta Travel On**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-05-28.SBD.Matrix.Flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 15 songs; 63 min [1]\n- **BillyStrings2017-05-28.CA14.Flac24**: source not stated; 12 songs; 66 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [2]. Said about its sound: Recording was accidentally paused twice when mics were moved because of the rain [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bryon Sutton joined on Raleigh and Spencer, Shackles and Chains, and Freeborn Man [3]\n- Billy opened for the Travelin' McCoury's and the Grateful Ball with Jeff Austin [1]\n- Noon main stage set; rain began, so taper moved mics under cover [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-05-28.SBD.Matrix.Flac24**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: SPC4 Hyper Card Mics + Soundboard > Tascam 70D (24/48) [1]. Also: Transfer path: SD card to CDWAV for tracking, then FLAC, tagged in Foobar2000; processed by Rich Stoler [1]\n- **BillyStrings2017-05-28.CA14.Flac24**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: CA-14 Cards > CA 9200 PowerAmp > TASCAM DR-100mkII [2]. Also: Church Audio CA-14 cards into CA 9200 preamp, Tascam DR-100mkII, mics twelve feet up in front of soundboard; dithered to 16-bit [2]",
